  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Here <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Hence, the vertex is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Slope of the line joining origin <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and vertex <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mo>–</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence, the slope of the normal is <math><mn>1</mn></math><br />Equation of the normal is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
